    {
      "id": "PETS",
      "choicePrompt": "",
      "background": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "杂志的封面上印着一只粉色的小狗。你原本只是随手翻阅，却不知不觉在那些小动物的照片上停留了许久。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……很可爱呢。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（再看一会儿，应该也没关系吧。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "纸页轻轻翻动，连日战斗带来的紧绷也随之松弛下来。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "嗷呜……",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": {
            "x": 47.1,
            "y": 679.8,
            "size": 184,
            "imageScale": 1,
            "imageOffsetX": -6,
            "imageOffsetY": 4.6
          },
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你循声望去。一只白虎正伏在不远处的少女身旁，其中一只眼睛似乎已经失明。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/12fb4370cf41a16d4ea7.png",
              "x": 684.4,
              "y": 921.7,
              "height": 820,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……白虎？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（为什么图书馆里会有白虎……而且，未免也太自然了些吧。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "正当你这样想着，少女轻柔的声音传了过来。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "记忆力很好的少女",
          "text": "嗯，真让人怀念啊。白虎，这是你小时候的照片哦。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": {
            "x": 47.1,
            "y": 679.8,
            "size": 184,
            "imageScale": 1,
            "imageOffsetX": 15.6,
            "imageOffsetY": 102.1
          },
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/1773ddfe2e21c0cffaf9.png",
              "x": 496.6,
              "y": 910.8,
              "height": 820,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER_2",
              "image": "res://images/story/4fbccf270e4e558dd149.png",
              "x": 1092.5,
              "y": 921.6,
              "height": 820,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（原来名字也叫白虎……稍微有些直白呢。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你顺着少女的目光低下头，这才发觉，她和白虎看的，竟然也是你手中的这本杂志。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "摊开的书页上，一只小小的白色幼兽蜷成一团。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……等等。她说的，难道是这一只？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你看了看照片，又看了看少女身旁的白虎。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/12fb4370cf41a16d4ea7.png",
              "x": 604.9,
              "y": 1293.6,
              "height": 1295,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（怎么看都还是只小猫呢……居然会长得这么大啊。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "少女轻轻抚摸着白虎的背，白虎则发出低低的呼噜声。你望着这一幕，唇角不自觉地浮起了一点笑意。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/1773ddfe2e21c0cffaf9.png",
              "x": 511.1,
              "y": 925.3,
              "height": 820,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER_2",
              "image": "res://images/story/4fbccf270e4e558dd149.png",
              "x": 854.2,
              "y": 921.7,
              "height": 820,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……连自己小时候的照片，也能认出来么。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（真是个聪明的孩子呢。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "一种莫名的安心感涌上心头。可就在你试图抓住那份熟悉的感觉时，脑海中忽然传来一阵刺痛。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/ae18a9c23d806d4f878b.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "再次睁眼，面前已是塔内冰冷的墙壁。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/94f82a588fa5f0bb389a.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（刚才的……究竟是什么？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（那个女孩，还有白虎……明明想不起在哪里见过，为什么会觉得这样怀念呢。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "TAKE_REWARD",
          "text": "温柔＋8，从3张卡牌中选择1张获得。",
          "description": "温柔＋8，从3张卡牌中选择1张获得。",
          "nextPage": "FINISHED",
          "rewards": {
            "sense": "Gentleness",
            "senseAmount": 8,
            "cardChoices": 3
          }
        }
      ],
      "characters": [],
      "metCharacters": [
        "erika",
        "byakko"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MODELS",
      "choicePrompt": "",
      "background": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……写真杂志？这种地方，居然也会有这些啊。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你略一迟疑，还是翻开了杂志。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……这、这身衣服，不纯desuwa！）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "指尖停在了书页的一角。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（不过……她穿起来的话，应该会很合适呢。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（下次让她试试看好了——）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……她？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "刚刚还十分自然的念头，忽然变得陌生起来。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你试着回想，脑海中却只有一抹模糊的粉色。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "明明连对方穿上那身衣服时，自己会是什么心情都隐约记得，却怎么也想不起她的面容。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……真是的。这种事情，怎么能忘记呢。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你有些焦躁地翻过一页，又翻过一页。杂志上的模特已无暇细看，直到一张照片让你的指尖猛地停住。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……等等。这位紫发的女性……）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "照片上的面容，渐渐与记忆中一道身影重叠起来。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（是“入队仪式”时，穿着军装站在演讲台上的那位吧？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……为什么会在写真杂志里看到她啊。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "一瞬间，连刚才的焦躁都被挤到了一旁。你重新看向照片，试图回忆她当时说过的话。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（我记得，那时候她——）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "脑海中忽然传来一阵刺痛。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/ae18a9c23d806d4f878b.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "再次睁眼，面前已是塔内冰冷的墙壁。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/94f82a588fa5f0bb389a.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……又是这样。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你按着额角，试着留住那些正在散去的印象。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（那道粉色的身影，还有穿着军装的那位……）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（明明应该记得的。为什么……偏偏想不起她们是谁呢。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "TAKE_REWARD",
          "text": "才能＋8，从3张卡牌中选择1张获得。",
          "description": "才能＋8，从3张卡牌中选择1张获得。",
          "nextPage": "FINISHED",
          "rewards": {
            "sense": "Talent",
            "senseAmount": 8,
            "cardChoices": 3
          }
        }
      ],
      "characters": [],
