      "lines": [
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你坐在桌前，安静地翻阅着手中的书。读到一半，旁边传来的交谈声让你的目光停在了纸页上。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "金发独眼少女",
          "text": "小希，果然还是和你待在一起最安心了啊。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": {
            "x": 47.1,
            "y": 679.8,
            "size": 184,
            "imageScale": 1.5,
            "imageOffsetX": 1.2,
            "imageOffsetY": 44.3
          },
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/8613b62c85505198d18d.png",
              "x": 529.1,
              "y": 928.9,
              "height": 820,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "戴眼镜的发型很危险的少女",
          "text": "……你刚才可不是这么说的吧。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/8613b62c85505198d18d.png",
              "x": 579.7,
              "y": 910.9,
              "height": 820,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER_2",
              "image": "res://images/story/cae0793d2d73e35fb623.png",
              "x": 1034.8,
              "y": 918,
              "height": 820,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "金发独眼少女",
          "text": "因为我们都和普通女孩子不太一样嘛。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": {
            "x": 47.1,
            "y": 679.8,
            "size": 184,
            "imageScale": 1.5,
            "imageOffsetX": 1.2,
            "imageOffsetY": 44.3
          },
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/6c295023aef890921773.png",
              "x": 579.7,
              "y": 910.9,
              "height": 820,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER_2",
              "image": "res://images/story/fc00b80636551994292e.png",
              "x": 1034.8,
              "y": 918,
              "height": 820,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "戴眼镜的发型很危险的少女",
          "text": "别一副理所当然的样子把我也算进去啊！",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": {
            "x": 47.1,
            "y": 679.8,
            "size": 184,
            "imageScale": 1.5,
            "imageOffsetX": 1.2,
            "imageOffsetY": 134.6
          },
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/6c295023aef890921773.png",
              "x": 579.7,
              "y": 910.9,
              "height": 820,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER_2",
              "image": "res://images/story/b1ca28cb9b5380524efd.png",
              "x": 1034.8,
              "y": 918,
              "height": 820,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你循声望去。戴着眼镜的少女正皱着眉头，另一位短发少女却笑得毫无反省之意，反而又往她身边凑了凑。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/6c295023aef890921773.png",
              "x": 832.5,
              "y": 910.9,
              "height": 581,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER_2",
              "image": "res://images/story/314c965ad5194b4acafb.png",
              "x": 1060.1,
              "y": 910.8,
              "height": 581,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……都被这样说了，还能笑得这么开心啊。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你垂下眼睛，试着继续阅读，唇角却不自觉地弯了起来。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（这种时候，越是搭理她，她就越得意呢。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（可要是真的不理她，又会凑过来问个不停……）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "翻页的动作忽然停住了。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……她？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你明明是在看旁边那两个人，却不知从什么时候起，想到了另一个人。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "脑海中隐约掠过一抹粉色。似乎也有谁，总喜欢这样凑到你的身边，说些让人不知该如何回答的话。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "而你大概也曾像那位戴眼镜的少女一样，皱着眉头，叹着气——却始终没有挪开身旁的位置。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……真是的。稍微安静一会儿，不行么。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "这个念头自然得，仿佛下一刻就该有人笑着回应。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "可你等了片刻，什么也没有想起来。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……我是在对谁说话呢。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "旁边的拌嘴还在继续。你低下头，同一行文字已经看了好几遍，却一个字也没能读进去。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（应该……是经常待在一起的人吧。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（不然，为什么连她会怎么惹我生气，都像是记得一样……）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你试着看清那抹粉色，脑海中却骤然传来一阵刺痛。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/ae18a9c23d806d4f878b.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "再次睁眼，面前已是塔内冰冷的墙壁。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/94f82a588fa5f0bb389a.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "那些吵吵闹闹的声音消失了。四周终于安静下来，你却下意识地看了一眼身旁。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "那里空无一人。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（……明明，也没有真的嫌你吵啊。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "（所以，至少让我想起……你的名字吧。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        }
      ],
